# CLAUDE.md

## Bootstrap Rule

For any non-trivial task, start with `AI_CONTEXT.md`.

Use this reading chain:

1. `CLAUDE.md`
2. `AI_CONTEXT.md`
3. `docs/context/project-overview.md`
4. `docs/context/retrofit-mapping.md`{{retrofitReadNote}}
5. `docs/context/development-roadmap.md`{{roadmapReadNote}}
6. `docs/context/architecture.md`
7. `docs/context/tech-stack.md`
8. relevant files under `docs/engineering/`
9. relevant files under `docs/tasks/`

## Purpose

This repository uses layered project context so a new AI conversation can recover the whole project meaning without scanning the whole repo.

- `AI_CONTEXT.md` is the compressed bootstrap index.
- `docs/context/` stores stable project meaning.
- `docs/engineering/` stores technical contracts.
- `docs/tasks/` stores module-local execution context.

